OL,3,GNEWSAStar backs city project to
OL,4,Ashowcase musical talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new strategy to help musicians in
OL,7,FBradford achieve their potential has
OL,8,Fbeen backed by city star Nia Archives.
OL,10,FThe Bradford-born singer-songwriter, DJ
OL,11,Fand producer, who spent her early years
OL,12,Fin the city before moving with her
OL,13,Ffamily to Leeds, has written a foreward
OL,14,Ffor the Bradford District Music
OL,15,FStrategy.
OL,17,FIt was launched at Bradford Live over
OL,18,Fthe weekend and is funded by Arts
OL,19,FCouncil England's Grassroots Music
OL,20,FFund.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
