OL,3,GNEWSAStar backs city project to
OL,4,Ashowcase musical talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe strategy has set out an "ambitious
OL,7,Fvision" for the city to be recognised
OL,8,Fas one of the UK's most distinctive
OL,9,Fmusic districts but also how its
OL,10,Fmusicians can get better access to
OL,11,Fvenues, equipment and industry
OL,12,Fexpertise.
